# ── SEO / Webmaster verification ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Paste the content="" value from the meta tag Google Search Console gives you.
PUBLIC_GSC_VERIFICATION=

# Paste the content="" value from the meta tag Bing Webmaster Tools gives you.
PUBLIC_BING_VERIFICATION=

# ── Newsletter capture ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The form action URL from your email provider (MailerLite, Buttondown, etc.)
# MailerLite example:  https://assets.mailerlite.com/jsonp/XXXXXXX/forms/XXXXXXX/subscribe
# Buttondown example:  https://buttondown.com/api/emails/embed-subscribe/YOUR-USERNAME
PUBLIC_NEWSLETTER_ENDPOINT=

# ── Site identity (used in astro.config and src/config.ts) ───────────────────
# Update src/config.ts directly — these are documented here for reference only.
# SITE_URL=https://venerable-lollipop-5e026d.netlify.app
